TI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Cbktlvci_z4HwdqPUW-5cg","review_id":"z4Ps4TgqirIG5cJ5TT5ypQ","date":"2019-04-04T20:13:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.945081353187561,"text_excerpt":"Had dinner with another couple recently; their first time visit. We enjoyed our experience. The atmosphere is so old school New Orleans that I like stopping in every few months when I'm visiting the quarter, but I hadn't visited in a while. I'm happy to report this is still a great spot for locals and tourists to grab lunch or dinner along with cheap drinks. Started with the calamari appetizer, which are always so clean and tasty. The calamari appetizer is still my most favorite dish on their menu! I just wish they gave a few more calamari than they did this time around for the price. For entrees one person chose the Cajun White Beans and Southern Fried Fish, which was absolutely deliciou..."},{"business_id":"Cbktlvci_z4HwdqPUW-5cg","review_id":"oxIfq19PcKWWgqOXe0jeig","date":"2015-07-07T01:04:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9342402219772339,"text_excerpt":"We popped in here for a quick dinner one night while visiting New Orleans. The service was fast, friendly, and attentive. I ordered the jambalaya. It was average. It didn't taste bad, but it wasn't the best jambalaya I've ever had. My boyfriend ordered the mulletta and he said it was very good! This is a decent and inexpensive place to grab a meal in the French quarter."},{"business_id":"Cbktlvci_z4HwdqPUW-5cg","review_id":"_KXGzqt1AB1VVWdGLAi5vQ","date":"2012-06-19T02:16:41","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9290780425071716,"text_excerpt":"If you like huge portions this is the place for you. Me and my wife stop out here every time we are in NOLA and for good reasons. They are one of the cheapest places in the French Quarter to eat and you get portions most normal folks can never finish. With their shrimp plate you get around 40 shrimp, fries and a salad all for around 13 bucks. Their sandwiches are huge as well. Do not get me wrong, this place is not to be compared with anything upper scale, more on the dive side but it is a great place to stop none the less. The staff that works their look rough as hell, but for the most part they are friendly and helpful. If you do not mind eating without all the pomp and flair for some p..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Cbktlvci_z4HwdqPUW-5cg","photo_id":"xMRMTwng9Wgc23y6fBNFHA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/xMRMTwng9Wgc23y6fBNFHA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.836962103843689},{"business_id":"Cbktlvci_z4HwdqPUW-5cg","photo_id":"-YZ4H6xbSi5ZhkSc0P_Ofw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-YZ4H6xbSi5ZhkSc0P_Ofw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8275509476661682},{"business_id":"Cbktlvci_z4HwdqPUW-5cg","photo_id":"ea5PeI_ejaGFu6rRJsNSEA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/ea5PeI_ejaGFu6rRJsNSEA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8269288539886475},{"business_id":"Cbktlvci_z4HwdqPUW-5cg","photo_id":"WBdvr4Q6S2w7f5ZGiobyLQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/WBdvr4Q6S2w7f5ZGiobyLQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8123723268508911},{"business_id":"Cbktlvci_z4HwdqPUW-5cg","photo_id":"MawS